"When switching from 720x576 16:9 aspect video (aspect2.ts) to 720x576 4:3 aspect video (aspect3.ts), the 4:3 aspect video is stretched on the sides and cannot be scaled by playerView.setResizeMode. Afterwards, after switching to 1280x720 16:9 aspect video (aspect1.ts), then again to 4:3 aspect video, the aspect ratio is fixed on the 4:3 aspect video, but if we then switch to 720x576 16:9 aspect video (aspect2.ts), the 16:9 video is squeezed and cannot be scaled by playerView.setResizeMode again. You can then switch it to 1280x720 16:9 video and back to fix it again.\r\n\r\n1) Run aspect2.ts, then switch to aspect3.ts\r\n2) Then switch to aspect1.ts, then switch back to aspect3.ts\r\n3) Then switch to aspect2.ts -> aspect1.ts -> aspect2.ts\r\n\r\n- http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect1.ts\r\n- http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect2.ts\r\n- http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect3.ts\r\n\r\n2.10.7\r\n\r\nNexus Player, Sony Android TV, Fire TV although it works correctly on nVidia Shield TV somehow.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Samrobbo","id":8195253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTUyNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8195253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo","html_url":"https://github.com/Samrobbo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoP